        {
            "key": "field_6255eb3399452",
            "label": "Content Block",
            "name": "content_block",
            "aria-label": "",
            "type": "repeater",
            "instructions": "You can repeat this block as many times as necessary depending on the content.\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Block Title:<\/strong> This field will be used to build the on-page navigation. It should be similar to the H2 but can be shortened if necessary. If this section does not start with an H2 (at the top of a page, for example) it is ok to leave this field blank.<br>\r\n<strong>Main Content:<\/strong> This will start with the H2 and include all copy between the H2 and the start of the H3s (if they exist for this block).<br>\r\n<strong>Include Accordions:<\/strong> Check this box if there are H3s nested beneath the current H2.<br>\r\n<strong>Accordion Title:<\/strong> This will be the H3.<br>\r\n<strong>Accordion Content:<\/strong> This will be the body copy associated with the above H3.",
